window.EN={"1":"The discovery of Lord Erik of Laus's collusion with the enemy dealt Roy and the others a further shock.","2":"Erik had hinted that he was not the only traitor.","3":"Lycia, the land Roy had always known... could no longer be called a safe place either.","4":"Roy and the others, heading for Ostia, in order to avoid needless danger,","5":"decided to pass through an old mountain road where few people traveled.","6":"Boss! That guy who went to scout the village earlier is back.","7":"Oh, then let's go shake down the villagers for their money and valuables, same as always.","8":"Nah, it ain't that simple.","9":"Seems like there's an army coming real close by.","10":"An army, you say!?","11":"Why the hell would an army need to pass through some run-down mountain road like this!?","12":"Dunno if it's true, but it looks like it's a Lycian army.","13":"Huh, if it's just the remnants of the Lycian Alliance that got crushed by Bern, there's nothing to be scared of.","14":"Ain't that the truth.","15":"Well, there's no harm in being careful, though.","16":"If things go well, we might even get our hands on some treasure...","17":"Give 'em a proper \"welcome\"!","18":"Lord Roy, a villager says they have something to ask of you...","19":"Oh, hey, wait up!","20":"Oh!! You must be Lord Roy of House Pherae, yes?","21":"That's right. Is there something you need from me?","22":"We'd like you to deal with the bandits!","23":"Bandits?","24":"The old castle on the mountain pass has become the bandits' hideout.","25":"Isn't there a garrison defending it?","26":"...The moment they heard the Lycian Alliance had lost, they scattered and fled.","27":"Those of us left behind live every single day in fear of the bandits.","28":"......","29":"There's no one else we can rely on. Please, help us!!","30":"Lord Roy, I feel for them, but for us, in a hurry as we are... it's a bit much.","31":"Yeah, I know.","32":"But I can't just abandon the people right in front of me and press on!","33":"Lord Roy!?","34":"You'll help us!? If you don't mind, please use the secret gate.","35":"It hasn't been used in a long time, but if you go through there, you'll come out right beside the castle.","36":"Understood.","37":"Then I'll go back ahead and arrange for the gate to open once you're nearby.","38":"Marinus! Let's head to the castle right away and drive off those bandits!","39":"Good grief, what a troublesome business.","40":"Well then, Dorothy, I'm counting on you. Make sure to pass this along to Saul too.","41":"Yes, Father Yodel.","42":"...Honestly, where has that priest gone off to?","43":"If he just wanders off on his own, there's no point in me being his escort.","44":"Father, I appreciate it, but I'm a bit...","45":"Now, now, don't say that. Tonight, let's have a nice, slow sermon from me...","46":"Ah, found him! Father!","47":"Hm. Dorothy.","48":"Well then, I'll be on my way...","49":"Ah, wait.","50":"...Good grief. Honestly, Dorothy.","51":"He ran off because you came marching up with that scary face of yours.","52":"I was born with this scary face!","53":"More importantly, Father, you were hitting on a girl again, weren't you?","54":"There you go again, inviting misunderstandings...","55":"I was merely offering salvation for the soul to a lost lamb...","56":"Then why does it have to be \"tonight\"?","57":"...Well, never mind that. Didn't you have some business with me?","58":"Oh, right. It seems the Lycian Alliance army will be arriving around here soon.","59":"What! Then that means Princess Guinivere is with them, doesn't it?","60":"That is, if what we were told at the Elimine Church headquarters wasn't wrong.","61":"I can't just sit here! I need to hurry and join that army.","62":"......","63":"What's the matter, Dorothy?","64":"...I hear Princess Guinivere is super gorgeous, you know~","65":"What foolishness are you talking about... Come on, let's go.","66":"O~kay.","67":"Right, I heard about it. Hold on a sec, I'll open it now.","68":"Wh-what the?! There was a gate over there?","69":"Tch. Pulling a slick move like that...","70":"Looks like you're having a hard time with enemies coming out one after another.","71":"When you want to stop enemy reinforcements from coming out of a fort,","72":"you just need an ally to go to that fort and block it off.","73":"As long as you hold that spot, the enemy simply can't get out.","74":"All the mountains around here are basically the bandits' own backyard.","75":"They're good with mountains, so they'll cross even the tallest ones without any trouble.","76":"Ah, how frightening...","77":"When Castle Araphen to the northeast was attacked by Bern...","78":"I... I was nearby.","79":"The Bern wyvern riders were terrifying too, but... something even... even more terrifying...","80":"I saw it.","81":"A dragon that swallowed up the Lycian army in its flame breath and destroyed everything...","82":"I... I must have just been dreaming.","83":"It's crazy, right? I mean, a dragon...","84":"...Please... tell me it was just a dream.","85":"Tell me it wasn't real!","86":"You lot, good timing. Could you hold onto this lance for me?","87":"I hear some amazing armor knight was using it.","88":"Rumor has it he beat twenty tough fighters from the Kingdom of Bern in a row at the arena.","89":"They say he's fighting against the Kingdom of Bern now, traveling with an energetic boy and a pretty young lady, three of them together.","90":"Same as you lot, huh.","91":"Nobody who's taken a hit from me has ever stayed standing.","92":"Hey you there, want to find out?","93":"Gah...! No... I don't wanna die yet...","94":"Lord Roy!! This is terrible! A monk of the Elimine Church...","95":"...has come asking for Lord Roy and Princess Guinivere!","96":"You mean he knew Princess Guinivere was traveling with us?","97":"Yes. I wonder what this is about.","98":"...I don't know.","99":"For now, I'll go meet him by myself.","100":"Lord Roy, I'll be fine. Let's hear what he has to say.","101":"Princess?","102":"Actually, relations between my brother and the Elimine Church have soured in recent years.","103":"I don't know the full circumstances, but I'm sure someone from the Church isn't an enemy.","104":"I see. Then, let's have him shown in here.","105":"Lord Roy, it's an honor to meet you. I am Saul of the Elimine Church.","106":"Nice to meet you.","107":"And...","108":"Oh! You must be Princess Guinivere!? Living up to the rumors — my, how beautiful!","109":"...?","110":"Now then, Princess Guinivere.","111":"I'd like to know the whereabouts of the \"Fire Emblem\" — you have it with you, don't you?","112":"!! How do you know about that...?","113":"We received word from our Church's branch in Bern.","114":"That the \"Fire Emblem\" had disappeared from the \"Shrine of Seals\".","115":"And that around the same time, you, Princess Guinivere, also disappeared from Bern.","116":".......","117":"I was sent by the Church to confirm the facts.","118":"Why? Why the \"Fire Emblem\"?","119":"...It's to stop my brother.","120":"Your brother... meaning His Majesty King Zephiel of Bern.","121":"Yes.","122":"Do you know, Princess, what exactly the \"Fire Emblem\" is?","123":"...The \"Fire Emblem\" is the key that awakens the dragon-sealing sword...","124":"My late father the king taught me that, long ago. But as for what that actually means...","125":"Still, my brother seemed afraid of the \"Fire Emblem\" falling into someone else's hands.","126":"By making the king believe it might have fallen into enemy hands...","127":"you intended to use that as a means to make him stop invading other countries, is that it?","128":"Yes. But the fighting broke out anyway...","129":"On behalf of the Elimine Church, I must ask — what will you do from here?","130":"...Must I really answer that right now?","131":"You have some idea in mind, don't you?","132":"Yes. I haven't given up on the path to reconciliation yet.","133":"I see. Then, might I accompany you as well?","134":"If Lord Roy permits it.","135":"I don't mind.","136":"...Lord Roy.","137":"I'm causing you all sorts of trouble.","138":"Not at all. Please don't worry about it.","139":"I hope the path to reconciliation the princess speaks of... goes well.","140":"...Yes."};
